00:47:10,448 --> 00:47:13,608
I was having so much fun. Are you sad, Pebbles? Are you sad?

390
00:47:13,888 --> 00:47:20,568
It's okay. This next song is extra special, and I think it's going to be really good and you're going to enjoy it. So...

391
00:47:20,828 --> 00:47:22,128
Are you ready?

392
00:47:22,368 --> 00:47:23,568
Let's go!

393
00:47:25,422 --> 00:47:32,742
傷ついた君のそのほほに触れる指先は震えてたんだ
The fingertips touching your wounded cheek were trembling.

394
00:47:33,042 --> 00:47:40,042
壊れそうな君の笑顔を守りたくて
I wanted to protect your fragile smile.

395
00:47:40,742 --> 00:47:47,742
すべてを投げ出してもいいと思ったんだ
I thought it would be fine to throw everything away.

396
00:47:48,742 --> 00:47:55,042
ねぇ聞こえているかい？この声が
Hey, can you hear this voice?

397
00:47:55,742 --> 00:48:03,442
描いた夢の続きを始めよう
Let's start the continuation of the dream we drew.

398
00:48:04,042 --> 00:48:11,342
小さな光を集めて
Gathering small lights,

399
00:48:11,742 --> 00:48:19,242
どこまでも行ける気がしたんだ
I felt like I could go anywhere.

400
00:48:19,742 --> 00:48:26,742
涙のあとに咲く花のように
Like a flower blooming after tears,

401
00:48:27,242 --> 00:48:35,242
強く美しくありたいと願った
I wished to be strong and beautiful.

402
00:48:36,242 --> 00:48:43,242
色づく世界の中で
In this coloring world,

403
00:48:43,742 --> 00:48:51,242
君と出会えた奇跡を歌うよ
I sing of the miracle of meeting you.

404
00:48:51,742 --> 00:48:59,242
たとえどんな未来が待っていようとも
No matter what kind of future awaits,

405
00:48:59,742 --> 00:49:08,242
この手を離さないと誓うよ
I swear I will never let go of this hand.

406
00:49:09,242 --> 00:49:24,242
lalala...

407
00:49:24,742 --> 00:49:32,742
いつでもこのままで
Staying like this forever,

408
00:49:33,242 --> 00:49:45,742
輝き続けるよ、君と一緒に
I will keep shining together with you.

409
00:51:06,889 --> 00:51:12,489
泣いたような声でさ 静かに笑うんだ
Smiling quietly with a voice like you've been crying...

410
00:51:12,489 --> 00:51:23,109
想像を写した 彩のパレット
A palette of colors reflecting imagination...

411
00:51:23,109 --> 00:51:26,169
Please, distinguish me.

412
00:51:26,169 --> 00:51:33,969
溢れ出す色を だれか止めてよ 消えちゃう
Someone stop these overflowing colors, they're going to disappear...

413
00:51:40,329 --> 00:51:51,529
「愛してる」を溶かした青は やさしいなみだ
The blue that melted "I love you" is a gentle tear...

414
00:51:56,209 --> 00:52:09,049
「ありがとう」を浮かべた赤に やさしいうたを
And a gentle song to the red floating with "Thank you"...

415
00:52:22,549 --> 00:52:32,809
(I will be「Eraser's mind」.)
(I will be "Eraser's mind".)

416
00:52:38,169 --> 00:52:50,469
紡ぎだす群青 廻る記憶に
Spinning ultramarine into the revolving memories...

417
00:52:56,769 --> 00:53:07,569
絡まった僕らの 未来が 色付く
Our intertwined future begins to color...

418
00:53:13,669 --> 00:53:27,129
「愛してる」を描いた黒は やさしいきおく
The black that drew "I love you" is gentle memories...

419
00:53:29,449 --> 00:53:47,569
「ありがとう」を溢した白に やさしいキスを
And a gentle kiss to the white overflowing with "Thank you"...

420
00:53:53,549 --> 00:54:04,549
優しい記憶を...
Gentle memories...

421
00:54:12,353 --> 00:54:14,753
Dear Pebbles,

422
00:54:15,013 --> 00:54:16,813
Hi! It's Biboo!

423
00:54:16,813 --> 00:54:19,653
How did you enjoy the showcase?

424
00:54:19,653 --> 00:54:23,253
Did it Rock? (Heh) To be honest,

425
00:54:23,253 --> 00:54:35,833
I missed you all lots these past few months! Not being able to stream as much and hang out with everyone was a little lonely...

426
00:54:35,833 --> 00:54:40,473
BUT! I knew the end result was going to be worth it!

427
00:54:40,473 --> 00:54:48,453
So, Biboo took all the feelings of her Pebbles who were cheering her on and turned it into - POWER!

428
00:54:48,453 --> 00:54:57,573
She learned so many new things like how to dance and different ways to sing all in the hopes that Pebbles would be proud of her one day!

429
00:54:57,573 --> 00:55:02,773
I hope one of those days is today.

430
00:55:02,773 --> 00:55:06,459
But TODAY is just the beginning!

431
00:55:06,594 --> 00:55:08,234
...getting after today,

432
00:55:08,494 --> 00:55:11,754
we've unlocked a whole new DIMENSION of Biboo!

433
00:55:12,374 --> 00:55:14,034
We're just getting started!

434
00:55:15,354 --> 00:55:22,154
So, no matter when or where you found me, I hope you'll continue to join me on this journey,
So, no matter when or where you found me, I hope you will continue to join me on this journey,

435
00:55:23,034 --> 00:55:24,834
TOGETHAAA!
TOGETHER!

436
00:55:25,694 --> 00:55:28,774
This small rock is gonna do BIG things!!
This small rock is going to do big things!!

437
00:55:31,534 --> 00:55:35,854
Today, I am shining bright because of you.

438
00:55:37,314 --> 00:55:42,134
So, from the bottom of my heart, thank you, Pebbles!

439
00:55:42,814 --> 00:55:45,354
Love, Biboo.

